  "invariants": [
    "No fee accrues on accrued unpaid fees or on a fee already embedded in pool NAV for the same service.",
    "Every accrual stores its computed base and is deterministically recomputable with zero tolerance.",
    "A fee settlement never consumes capacity reserved for an approved grant without an explicit OD-10 decision.",
    "Revenue is recognized only at settlement (RCD-018).",
    "The waiver requester never approves the waiver."
  ]
}
